[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17220.948, "timestamp": "04:47:00", "text": "回路図みたいなやつ。ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17223.43, "timestamp": "04:47:03", "text": "概略図。ええ、見つけましたよ。私は幸運だった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17226.708, "timestamp": "04:47:06", "text": "それを見つけた。ここには来ないでください。何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17228.55, "timestamp": "04:47:08", "text": "これですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17231.11, "timestamp": "04:47:11", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17233.03, "timestamp": "04:47:13", "text": "これは何ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17237.07, "timestamp": "04:47:17", "text": "これは太陽のようなものじゃないか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17239.83, "timestamp": "04:47:19", "text": "パネル？そうそう。あれがソーラーパネルです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17243.67, "timestamp": "04:47:23", "text": "どうやらこのゲームにはソーラーパネルが搭載されているらしい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17246.23, "timestamp": "04:47:26", "text": "いいえ、そうです。それは持っていません"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17248.877, "timestamp": "04:47:28", "author": "@baebae8403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/OdCljOM7Z-IW-aduSOxmr7dLa3EadW4Esy80MxUu6e5ZFoEtOrbG5Sn-Ar2tm7N25BpvPHou=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "daylight detector"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17259.11, "timestamp": "04:47:39", "text": "それから？ああ、それは日光検出器ですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17263.83, "timestamp": "04:47:43", "text": "わかった。そうそう。ええ、それはちょっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17269.628, "timestamp": "04:47:49", "text": "電話できます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17274.31, "timestamp": "04:47:54", "text": "しかし、それはあなたができることと全く同じではありません。"}]